                        <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                          <scr:Name>StimulusStartBeep</scr:Name>
                          <scr:Description>Skip count before lick detection starts: 1 as before, or laserLeadsStimulusBySeconds / 50 ms in an optogenetics experiment. As before, it arms at the first tone pip on trial 1 and one beep (50 ms) earlier from trial 2, because BeepTimer replays the previous trial's last beep to the new subscription.</scr:Description>
