                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:CombineLatest" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="io:WriteLine" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                          <Selector>Item2</Selector>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Dematerialize" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="2" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source2" />
                        <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Repeat" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
                    <Name>StimulusLogger</Name>
                    <Description>Writes BonsaiData\BonsaiData_StimulusState_&lt;time&gt;.csv (OpenRigs.Logging LogData): one row per beep while the trial is active, stamped with the Harp time of the beep, built by LogStimulus. Here rather than in Logging because StimulusLogRow is declared inside this group, as in Tom Childs' workflow (a logger in Logging cannot subscribe to a subject declared in TaskLogic: Bonsai reports a circular definition). Not part of the repeating trial chain, so it writes one file per experiment, created with its first row. AutoFlush writes each row to disk as it comes (about 20 a second, which LogData's AutoFlush is for): without it the file reached disk in 4 KB blocks, so the manifest's end-of-run write, which comes before this writer closes, recorded a size that stopped at the last full block (test-1802 and test-1813, 9 Nov 2026), and a Bonsai ended by force would lose up to 4 KB of beeps.</Description>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>StimulusLogRow</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                          <Selector>Row</Selector>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                          <Selector>Seconds</Selector>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="harp:CreateTimestamped" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogData.bonsai">
                          <LogName>BonsaiData_StimulusState</LogName>
                          <Selector />
                          <AutoFlush>true</AutoFlush>
                          <Extension>csv</Extension>
                        </Expression>
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="0" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="1" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source2" />
                        <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskParams</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Name>StimulusStartBeep</scr:Name>
                    <scr:Description>First beep with a tone pip: 1 as before, or laserLeadsStimulusBySeconds / 50 ms in an optogenetics experiment, so the laser (on at beep 0) leads the stimulus by laserLeadsStimulusBySeconds on every trial of that experiment, laser-on or laser-off.</scr:Description>
                    <scr:Expression>it.Optogenetics.UseZapit ? Convert.ToInt32(Math.Round(it.Optogenetics.LaserLeadsStimulusBySeconds / 0.05)) : 1</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="Count" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="50" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="57" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="4" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="10" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="11" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="13" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="41" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="9" To="12" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="9" To="40" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="10" To="12" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="14" To="18" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="17" To="20" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="18" To="19" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="19" To="20" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="20" To="21" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="21" To="22" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="22" To="23" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="23" To="24" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="24" To="25" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="25" To="33" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="26" To="27" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="27" To="32" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="28" To="29" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="29" To="32" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="30" To="31" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="31" To="32" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="32" To="33" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="33" To="34" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="34" To="35" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="35" To="36" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="36" To="37" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="37" To="60" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="38" To="40" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="39" To="40" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="40" To="41" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="41" To="42" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="42" To="43" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="42" To="46" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="43" To="44" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="44" To="45" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="45" To="48" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="46" To="47" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="47" To="48" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="48" To="49" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="49" To="53" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="50" To="51" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="50" To="52" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="51" To="53" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="52" To="53" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="53" To="54" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="53" To="56" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="53" To="57" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="54" To="55" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="55" To="59" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="56" To="57" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="57" To="58" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="58" To="59" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="59" To="60" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="60" To="61" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="61" To="62" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="62" To="63" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="63" To="64" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="66" To="67" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="67" To="68" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="68" To="3" Label="Source2" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>StartTrials</Name>
        <Description>Subscribes TaskLogic, the trial loop, once the experiment folder exists (PathPrefix, about 1 s after Go) and the tones are loaded (WaveformDict, from the task read at Go), 0.5 s later so the experiment's logs are open before trial 1. Tom Childs' workflow started on the GUI's Start Session.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>PathPrefix</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>WaveformDict</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Delay">
                <rx:DueTime>PT0.5S</rx:DueTime>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:SubscribeWhen" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="1" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="0" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>VirtualPosition</Name>
        <Description>The mouse's position along this trial's track (MouseVirtualPosition, cm), from the wheel distance since the trial started; TrialDistFloor keeps the position from going back past a reached point. Tom Childs' top-level nodes.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>WheelDistanceCm</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialStartWheelDistance</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Name>TrialDistance</scr:Name>
              <scr:Expression>it.Item1 - it.Item2</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject">
              <Name>TrialDistance</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialDistance</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialDistFloor</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrackLength</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialEnded</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Name>CalcVirtualPos</scr:Name>
                    <scr:Description>Prevent pos &lt; 0cm or &gt;TrackLengthcm. Gate on TrialEnded to prevent stale feedback.</scr:Description>
                    <scr:Expression>new (
            Convert.ToBoolean(it.Item2) ? 0.0 : Math.Min(it.Item1.Item1.Item2, it.Item1.Item1.Item1) as Floor,
            Convert.ToBoolean(it.Item2) ? 0.0 : Math.Min((it.Item1.Item1.Item1 - Math.Min(it.Item1.Item1.Item2, it.Item1.Item1.Item1)), it.Item1.Item2) as VirtualPos
            )</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Floor</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>TrialDistFloor</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>VirtualPos</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject">
              <Name>MouseVirtualPosition</Name>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="7" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="9" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="15" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Grating</Name>
        <Description>The drifting grating (BonVision DrawGratings) on the dome, its spatial frequency and opacity set by TaskLogic.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>DrawStimuli</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="sys:Double">
              <rx:Name>GratingSpatialFrequency</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="SpatialFrequency" Selector="it" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="sys:Double">
              <rx:Name>GratingOpacity</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="Opacity" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="BonVision:Primitives.DrawGratings.bonsai">
              <LocationX>0</LocationX>
              <LocationY>30</LocationY>
              <Layer>1</Layer>
              <ExtentX>270</ExtentX>
              <ExtentY>105</ExtentY>
              <SpatialFrequency>0.3</SpatialFrequency>
              <TemporalFrequency>0</TemporalFrequency>
              <Phase>16.8036766</Phase>
              <Angle>90</Angle>
              <SquareWave>false</SquareWave>
              <Contrast>1</Contrast>
              <DutyCycle xsi:nil="true" />
              <Radius>1000</Radius>
              <Aperture>0</Aperture>
              <Opacity>0</Opacity>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="5" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source3" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>TrialRow</Name>
        <Description>Each trial's BonsaiData_Trial row (TrialRow), built when the trial's outcome is known (TrialOutcome: after the reward tone on a reward, after the error tone and timeout on a punishment, at once otherwise) from the latest value of each subject, and stamped with the Harp time then (Seconds). Tom Childs' TrialLog was built 2 s later, at TrialEnded, so a Stop in between lost the trial (audit, 9 Nov 2026). Columns are named and typed as the lab's list allows (K:\config\data-dictionary.json) and described in schemas\trial-columns.yml. outcome is av-dome's Correct, Incorrect or NoResponse (Pip, 9 Nov 2026), so rig-control's performance is Tom's success rate.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialOutcome</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>Outcome?</Name>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Modality</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialNumber</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>StageRow</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialEndFreq</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialEndFreqV</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrackLength</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialDistance</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>WasRewarded</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>WasTimeout</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>HitEndOfTrack</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TruncationPoint</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ITIStartHarp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>InterTrialInterval</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialStartHarp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>StimulusOnsetTime</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>OutcomeHarp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>WasPunished</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskParams</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>OptoTrial</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>HarpTime</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Name>BuildTrialRow</scr:Name>
              <scr:Expression>new(Convert.ToInt32(it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2) as trialNumber, it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2.ToString().ToLower() as trialType, (it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 ? &quot;Correct&quot; : it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 || it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 || !it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2.LickToReward ? &quot;NoResponse&quot; : &quot;Incorrect&quot;) as outcome, (it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 ? &quot;EndOfTrack&quot; : it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 ? &quot;Timeout&quot; : !it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2.LickToReward ? &quot;FreqReached&quot; : it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 ? &quot;CorrectLick&quot; : &quot;WrongLickLimit&quot;) as endReason, it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 &amp;&amp; it.Item1.Item1.Item2.Punishment.Sound.Enabled as punishSound, (it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 ? it.Item1.Item1.Item2.Punishment.TimeoutSeconds : 0.0) as punishTimeoutSeconds, Convert.ToDouble(it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2) as trackLengthCm, Convert.ToDouble(it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2) as endPositionCm, Convert.ToDouble(it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2) as toneEndFrequencyHz, Convert.ToDouble(it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2) as visualEndSpatialFrequencyCpd, Convert.ToDouble(it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2) as truncationFraction, it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 as itiStartTime, it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2.TotalSeconds as itiSeconds, it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 as trialStartTime, it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 as stimulusOnsetTime, it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2 as outcomeTime, it.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item1.Item2.RewardSizeUl as rewardSizeUl, it.Item1.Item2.OptogeneticLaserPowerMw as laserPowerMw, it.Item1.Item2.OptogeneticCondition as laserCondition)</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Item2</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="harp:CreateTimestamped" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject">
              <Name>TrialRow</Name>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="3" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="5" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="7" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="9" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="11" To="13" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="13" To="15" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="17" To="19" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="18" To="19" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="19" To="21" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="20" To="21" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="21" To="23" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="22" To="23" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="23" To="25" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="24" To="25" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="25" To="27" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="26" To="27" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="27" To="29" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="28" To="29" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="30" To="31" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="31" To="33" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="32" To="33" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="33" To="35" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="34" To="35" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="35" To="37" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="36" To="37" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="37" To="39" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="38" To="39" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="39" To="41" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="40" To="41" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="41" To="42" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="41" To="43" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="42" To="44" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="43" To="44" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="44" To="45" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="45" To="46" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="29" To="31" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="17" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Logging</Name>
        <Description>Everything written to the experiment folder: LogControllerLogic makes the folder at Go and publishes PathPrefix; ExperimentLogs holds every log that waits for it; BonsaiData_Async takes the controller's events and each reward from Start; RecordHarpDevices, ExperimentManifest and the Recording phase follow PathPrefix.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
              <Name>LogControllerLogic</Name>
              <Description>Waits for Go (RunSettings: the controller's SubjectId and SessionId), then LogController creates the experiment folder RootPath\sub-&lt;SubjectId&gt;\ses-&lt;SessionId&gt;_&lt;DateTime&gt; and publishes it as PathPrefix, which every log waits for. RootPath is rig.yml's, the rig's acquisition folder itself (C:\Coen-Lab-Local\Acquired-Data): experiments have no project folder.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>RunSettings</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="SubjectId" Selector="Item1" />
                      <Property Name="SessionId" Selector="Item2" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>RootPath</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="Path" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogController.bonsai">
                    <SubjectId>UNMAPPED</SubjectId>
                    <SessionId>UNMAPPED</SessionId>
                    <Path>C:\Coen-Lab-Local\Acquired-Data</Path>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:DelaySubscription">
                      <rx:DueTime>PT1S</rx:DueTime>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>RunSettings</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:SubscribeWhen" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogAsync.bonsai" />
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>PathPrefix</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
              <Name>ExperimentLogs</Name>
              <Description>Starts every experiment log once LogControllerLogic publishes PathPrefix. TrialParameters writes BonsaiData_Trial (LogTrial): one row per trial, built by the TrialRow group when the outcome is known (TrialRow, a PublishSubject: trials start only after PathPrefix, so no row comes before the folder): the trial's draws, stage, outcome and why it ended, positions and frequencies, and its Harp times (itiStartTime, trialStartTime, stimulusOnsetTime, outcomeTime), with Seconds the time the row was built. Its columns are named and typed as the lab's list allows (K:\config\data-dictionary.json; rig-control checks before launch), and what each means (codes, units, former names) is schemas\trial-columns.yml, which ExperimentManifest copies into each experiment's manifest; settings that are the same throughout the experiment are not columns, being in the experiment's settings files (Settings\Settings_Rig_, Settings_Task_ and Settings_Experiment_&lt;DateTime&gt;.json: rig.yml as read, the task as read at Go, and from ExperimentSettings the subject, session, workflow, commit, who launched and sent Go and every ExperimentControl parameter at Go), and each trial's optogenetic draw is in its laserPowerMw and laserCondition columns. Subjects that already hold a value (BehaviorSubject, AsyncSubject) hand it to the late subscriber. Values set at startup, such as the Zapit startup replies and the first trial draw, are therefore logged when the experiment logs start, about a second after Go, with that time. Add new loggers inside this group.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
                    <Name>TrialParameters</Name>
                    <Description>Writes each trial's row (TrialRow, built by the TrialRow group when the outcome is known, stamped then) into BonsaiData_Trial.</Description>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>TrialRow</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogTrial.bonsai" />
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
                    <Name>BehaviorBoard</Name>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>BehaviorBoard-Main.Data</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Extensions\LoggingPrefixCondition.bonsai" />
                        <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
                          <Name>ExcludeAnalogDataMaybe</Name>
                          <Workflow>
                            <Nodes>
                              <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                                <Name>Source1</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
                                <Property Name="Value" DisplayName="ExcludeAnalogData?" />
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                                <Combinator xsi:type="BooleanProperty">
                                  <Value>false</Value>
                                </Combinator>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                                <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
                                <Name>Flagged</Name>
                                <Workflow>
                                  <Nodes>
                                    <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                                      <Name>Source1</Name>
                                    </Expression>
                                    <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                                      <Selector>Item2</Selector>
                                    </Expression>
                                    <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                                  </Nodes>
                                  <Edges>
                                    <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                                    <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                                  </Edges>
                                </Workflow>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                                <Selector>Item1</Selector>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="beh:FilterRegister">
                                <harp:FilterType>Exclude</harp:FilterType>
                                <harp:Register xsi:type="beh:AnalogData" />
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
                                <Name>NotFlagged</Name>
                                <Workflow>
                                  <Nodes>
                                    <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                                      <Name>Source1</Name>
                                    </Expression>
                                    <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                                      <Selector>Item2</Selector>
                                    </Expression>
                                    <Expression xsi:type="BitwiseNot" />
                                    <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                                  </Nodes>
                                  <Edges>
                                    <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                                    <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                                    <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                                  </Edges>
                                </Workflow>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                                <Selector>Item1</Selector>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                                <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                            </Nodes>
                            <Edges>
                              <Edge From="0" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source2" />
                              <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="3" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="6" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source2" />
                              <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
                            </Edges>
                          </Workflow>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogHarpDevice.bonsai">
                          <LogName>BehaviorBoard-Main</LogName>
                        </Expression>
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
                    <Name>Cameras</Name>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>PathPrefix</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
                          <Workflow>
                            <Nodes>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>Camera-Face.Data</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                                <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Skip">
                                  <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                                </Combinator>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogVideo.bonsai">
                                <LogName>Camera-Face</LogName>
                                <FrameRate>50</FrameRate>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>Camera-Pupil.Data</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                                <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Skip">
                                  <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                                </Combinator>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogVideo.bonsai">
                                <LogName>Camera-Pupil</LogName>
                                <FrameRate>50</FrameRate>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>Camera-Body.Data</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                                <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Skip">
                                  <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                                </Combinator>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogVideo.bonsai">
                                <LogName>Camera-Body</LogName>
                                <FrameRate>50</FrameRate>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>BehaviorBoard-Main</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                                <PropertyMappings>
                                  <Property Name="FrameRate" Selector="Settings.CameraTriggerController.Trigger0Frequency" />
                                </PropertyMappings>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>BehaviorBoard-Main</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                                <PropertyMappings>
                                  <Property Name="FrameRate" Selector="Settings.CameraTriggerController.Trigger0Frequency" />
                                </PropertyMappings>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                                <Name>BehaviorBoard-Main</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                                <PropertyMappings>
                                  <Property Name="FrameRate" Selector="Settings.CameraTriggerController.Trigger0Frequency" />
                                </PropertyMappings>
                              </Expression>
                            </Nodes>
                            <Edges>
                              <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="10" To="2" Label="Source2" />
                              <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="12" To="5" Label="Source2" />
                              <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="14" To="8" Label="Source2" />
                            </Edges>
                          </Workflow>
                        </Expression>
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
                    <Name>LicketySplit</Name>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>LicketySplit-Left.Data</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Extensions\LoggingPrefixCondition.bonsai" />
                        <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogHarpDevice.bonsai">
                          <LogName>LicketySplit-Left</LogName>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>LicketySplit-Right.Data</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Extensions\LoggingPrefixCondition.bonsai" />
                        <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogHarpDevice.bonsai">
                          <LogName>LicketySplit-Right</LogName>
                        </Expression>
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TimestampGeneratorGen3-Main.Data</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Extensions\LoggingPrefixCondition.bonsai" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogHarpDevice.bonsai">
                    <LogName>TimestampGeneratorGen3-Main</LogName>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rig:SerializeToJson">
                      <rig:Formatting>Indented</rig:Formatting>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
                    <Name>Settings_Rig</Name>
                    <Extension>json</Extension>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="task:SerializeToJson">
                      <task:Formatting>Indented</task:Formatting>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
                    <Name>Settings_Task</Name>
                    <Extension>json</Extension>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
                      <Name>ZapitReplies</Name>
                      <Description>Harp-timestamped log of every Zapit reply: the presented condition and laser state per StartStimulus, plus the last startup query reply (GetNumConditions), handed over by the ZapitReplies BehaviorSubject when ExperimentLogs starts.</Description>
                      <Workflow>
                        <Nodes>
                          <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                            <Name>ZapitReplies</Name>
                          </Expression>
                          <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                            <scr:Expression>new(
                  CommandCode as command,
                  Value as value,
                  LaserOn as laserOn,
                  IsError as isError,
                  ServerDatenum as serverDatenum)</scr:Expression>
                          </Expression>
                          <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
                            <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                          </Expression>
                          <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogData.bonsai">
                            <LogName>BonsaiData_ZapitReplies</LogName>
                            <Selector />
                            <Extension>csv</Extension>
                          </Expression>
                          <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                        </Nodes>
                        <Edges>
                          <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                          <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                          <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                          <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                        </Edges>
                      </Workflow>
                    </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>StepperDriver1Events</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Extensions\LoggingPrefixCondition.bonsai" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogHarpDevice.bonsai">
                    <LogName>StepperDriver-A</LogName>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>StepperDriver2Events</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Extensions\LoggingPrefixCondition.bonsai" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogHarpDevice.bonsai">
                    <LogName>StepperDriver-B</LogName>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>ExperimentGo</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ExperimentSettings" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
                    <Name>Settings_Experiment</Name>
                    <Extension>json</Extension>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskRandom</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Name>RngSeed</Name>
                    <Description>The seed every draw of the experiment follows from (the task file's rngSeed, or one drawn at Go when it is null), logged once: the Take(1) is after the multicast, not before it. A MulticastSubject passes on its source's completion, and a Take(1) ahead of it completed the shared AsyncEvents subject a second after Go, so no reward, Stop or other Async event was logged after RngSeed and rig-control counted no water (test-1802, 9 Nov 2026). After the multicast, the Take(1) unsubscribes as the seed passes, and TaskRandom (a BehaviorSubject) never completes.</Description>
                    <Selector>Seed</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                      <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="orl:CreateAsyncEvent">
                      <orl:Event>RngSeed</orl:Event>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
                    <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>AsyncEvents</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
                    <Name>OptogeneticsExperiment?</Name>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                          <Name>Source1</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                          <Selector>TaskParameters.Optogenetics.UseZapit</Selector>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>TaskParameters.Optogenetics.ZapitConfigPath</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="ext:ZapitConditionsSnapshot" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
                    <Name>Settings_ZapitConditions</Name>
                  </Expression>
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="17" To="18" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="18" To="19" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="20" To="21" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="21" To="22" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="23" To="24" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="24" To="26" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="26" To="27" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="27" To="28" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="28" To="25" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="29" To="30" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="30" To="31" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="31" To="32" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="32" To="33" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RewardLineLeft</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RewardLineRight</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>DO1?</Name>
              <Description>Passes the reward line on DO1 when it is calibrated, whichever side rewardValves gives it.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>Calibrated &amp;&amp; Line == 1</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>ArtefactJson</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
              <Name>ValveCalibrationDO1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>DO2?</Name>
              <Description>Passes the reward line on DO2 when it is calibrated, whichever side rewardValves gives it.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>Calibrated &amp;&amp; Line == 2</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>ArtefactJson</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
              <Name>ValveCalibrationDO2</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RewardDelivered</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
              <Name>Timestamp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>PathPrefix</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>path</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportPhase">
                <orcl:Phase>Recording</orcl:Phase>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="hd:RecordHarpDevices">
              <Name>RecordHarpDevices</Name>
              <Description>Checks every Harp device in rig.yml at Start and records it into each experiment (OpenRigs.HarpDevices): the Behavior board, the timestamp generator, both stepper drivers and both Lickety Splits (each a rig.yml entry with a portName whose data the workflow publishes as &lt;Name&gt;.Data) must be on their portName with their usbSerial, or the workflow stops saying which board is where; 0.5 s after the experiment folder appears it asks each for a register dump on &lt;Name&gt;.Commands, which its log records; and it writes &lt;Name&gt;\&lt;Name&gt;_device.json and the register map &lt;Name&gt;\&lt;Name&gt;.yml, which ExperimentManifest expects (harp).</Description>
              <hd:ConfigRoot>C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs</hd:ConfigRoot>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="mf:ExperimentManifest">
              <Name>ExperimentManifest</Name>
              <Description>Writes manifest.json into the experiment folder (OpenRigs.Manifest), as av-dome's: the machine, this repo's commit, who launched it and sent Go, rig.yml and the calibration files the workflow reads (MeshMap.csv, gammalut.bmp, this mouse's spout positions) by hash, what each BonsaiData_Trial column means (schemas\trial-columns.yml), and what the experiment must leave: a folder for each device in rig.yml, the Harp device records, the three settings files and BonsaiData (Trial, Async and StimulusState).</Description>
              <mf:IngestScript>coen-dome-navigation</mf:IngestScript>
              <mf:ConfigFiles>C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs\%COMPUTERNAME%\rig.yml;C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs\%COMPUTERNAME%\calibration\MeshMap.csv;C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs\%COMPUTERNAME%\calibration\gammalut.bmp;C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs\%COMPUTERNAME%\calibration\LickSpoutPositions\{SubjectId}.csv</mf:ConfigFiles>
              <mf:ExpectedFiles>auto;harp;Settings/Settings_Rig_;Settings/Settings_Task_;Settings/Settings_Experiment_;BonsaiData/</mf:ExpectedFiles>
              <mf:TrialColumns>schemas\trial-columns.yml</mf:TrialColumns>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Expression>new(&quot;RewardDelivered&quot; as Event, it.Side.ToString() + &quot; DO&quot; + it.Line.ToString() + &quot; requested=&quot; + it.RequestedUl.ToString() + &quot; pulses=&quot; + it.Count.ToString() + &quot; calibrated=&quot; + it.Calibrated.ToString() + &quot; clamped=&quot; + it.Clamped.ToString() as Detail, it.DeliveredUl as Value)</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orl:CreateAsyncEvent">
                <orl:Event>RewardDelivered</orl:Event>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>AsyncEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ControlEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Expression>new((it.Kind.ToString() == &quot;Command&quot; ? it.Name : it.Kind.ToString()) as Event, it.ToString() as Detail)</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orl:CreateAsyncEvent">
                <orl:Event>Control</orl:Event>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
              <Name>Timestamp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>AsyncEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="6" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="20" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="20" To="21" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="21" To="14" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="14" To="22" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="23" To="24" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="24" To="25" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="25" To="26" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="26" To="27" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="lv:StreamDevices">
        <Name>LiveView</Name>
        <Description>Streams every device in this machine's rig.yml that the workflow publishes, over ZeroMQ, for the live view (OpenRigs.LiveView): data on TCP 5556, video on 5558, from Start, in ready mode too. The three cameras as Camera-Face/Pupil/Body.video, 5 JPEG frames a second at 320 x 240, and the Behavior board's encoder from BehaviorBoard-Main.Data, 10 a second; each rate and size can be changed in rig.yml under the device's liveView:. Also elapsed, seconds since the experiment folder appeared, and liveview, this workflow and its commit. Every message carries the rig and the session key, ready until the experiment folder exists. Last in the workflow, because it streams only subjects built before it. A port already in use stops the workflow at Start.</Description>
        <lv:ConfigRoot>C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs</lv:ConfigRoot>
        <lv:DataPort>5556</lv:DataPort>
        <lv:VideoPort>5558</lv:VideoPort>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
